 "_lane": "Bahamut (FFX aeon; the black armoured winged dragon; the possessed Bahamut of Chapter III and a summon in nine more chapters): one costume across idle, attack, cast, hurt and KO (palette 0.94 to 1.00), so the idle's painting is the costume and the other poses are bent from it. Cut by polygons and the underlaps (no SAM): the long curled tail (one part, a 10-bone chain through the loop, the pale far run and the spade), the far (left) wing and the big (right) wing, the near leg (the figure shows one), the clawed left arm, the body (torso, pauldrons, the hanging right arm, hips) and the head with its translucent fin. Only the four leg bones scale (none here: the one leg) and no head, wing, chest, pelvis or tail bone does. Game case: FFX only (an FFX aeon's painting set); the rig stays OFF. EXPRESSIVE KEYS (rig-expressive-2 lane, 2026-10-19): the Bahamut-x pilot's head+neck and wing pieces for the attack and hurt keys, cut from Spathi's own attack and hurt paintings (the polygons moved by the twin registration, 60 px at 1x = 120 master px); keys = bahamut-x.keys.json.",
